cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use bioSSbD-py, please cite it as below."
type: software
abstract: "Open-source Python toolbox with a step-by-step graphical interface for Safe-and-Sustainable-by-Design (SSbD) assessment of process-based and bio-based systems, following the revised European Commission SSbD framework: scoping, safety, environmental and socio-economic assessment, non-aggregated evaluation with robustness analysis, and documentation."
title: "bioSSbD-py: an open-source toolbox for Safe-and-Sustainable-by-Design assessment of process-based and bio-based systems"
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-11-17
